          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "This list entry was subject to a Minor Amendment on 1 May 2026 to update the Name and Address and reformat the text to current standards TL 00 SE 3/8 ABBOTS LANGLEY Pimlico BEDMOND ROAD (East side) Former Barn and outbuildings about 15 metres South of Rose Acre House (Formerly listed as Barn and outbuildings about 15m S of Bourzuei, previously  listed as Barn on SE side of yard at Rose Acre) 11.11.82 GV II Barn. C17 or C18. Timber frame on brick base. Weatherboarded. Tiled roof. Six bays. To yard a slate roofed lean-to addition. Away from yard are three lower doors and three double loft doors. Interior: queen strut to collar clasping purlin trusses, braces in walling. Attached to end nearer house and running along road towards house is a long range of outbuildings enclosing the yard. C19. Stock brick and weatherboarded to yard. Flint with red brick dressings to road. Tiled and slated roofs. Seven bay brick main range with two weatherboarded bays added to left, one flint bay to right both with lower slate roofs. Entrances and windows with cambered heads. To road an entrance in one bay addition, brick quoins and eaves bands. Listing NGR: TL0949604765"
    }
  ],
